SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315509059/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260702T013119Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T013119Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315675744@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Crooked Goat (MUST  read description)
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🧠🍻 Trivia Ni
 ght at Crooked Goat! 🍻🧠\n\nWho's in? Join us for a fun night of triv
 ia\, laughs\, and great company!\n\nPlease RSVP only if you know you'll be
  there by 6:00 PM. This place gets packed fast\, and they don't allow rese
 rved seating\, so I won't be able to save seats for anyone arriving later.
 \n\n⏰ Please plan to arrive no later than 6:00 PM. Trivia starts promptl
 y at 6:30 PM\, and getting there early is the best way to make sure we can
  all sit together.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315675744/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260714T022143Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T022143Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315402142@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T210000
SUMMARY:Board game night at Henhouse brewing in Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nLooking for a nigh
 t filled with board games\, laughter\, and great company? Look no further!
  Join us for an evening of tabletop fun at Henhouse brewing\n\nGather your
  favorite board games or explore the brewery's selection\, and let's roll 
 dice\, strategize\, and compete in a friendly and relaxed atmosphere. Whet
 her you're a board game veteran or just looking to try something new\, eve
 ryone is welcome to join in on the fun.\n\nBring your competitive spirit\,
  your favorite games\, and an appetite for some craft brews and delicious 
 bites. It's the perfect setting to enjoy fantastic company and fun tableto
 p games.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315402142/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260624T204413Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260624T204413Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315729442@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T190000
SUMMARY:Hot Amphitheater Nights ( free music )
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nJuly 25 – Top Sh
 elf Classics (Soul\, R&B\, Motown\, Pop\, Funk\, & Jazz)⁠\n\nFree Admiss
 ion | 5:00-7:00pm\n\nHeld at the Hamilton Amphitheater\, 601 N. Hamilton P
 kwy\n\nThere will be food available for purchase at this event. It’s not
  a big selection so feel free to bring your own food/drinks . I recommend 
 bringing a chair unless you plan to stand the whole time.\n\nParking is li
 mited on the street but there are available spots at these locations:\n\nH
 amilton Community Center\,\n503 S. Palm Dr.\n&\nHamilton Old Gym\,\n115 Sa
 n Pablo Ave.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315729442/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260717T233440Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T233440Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315729799@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T190000
SUMMARY:Gas Money (free music )
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎶 Join me for a
  FREE concert at Juilliard Park! 🎶\n\n📍 Juilliard Park\n227 Santa Ro
 sa Avenue\, Santa Rosa\n\nCome enjoy a summer evening with Gas Money\, a t
 alented young band playing a fun mix of rock and Motown!\n\nThis will be m
 y first time at Juilliard Park\, and from what I can tell\, it's just a fe
 w blocks from the SMART train station if you'd rather skip driving.\n\nI'l
 l be bringing a lawn chair\, so feel free to bring one too\, along with a 
 blanket\, snacks\, or a picnic dinner if you'd like.\n\nOnce I arrive\, I'
 ll post what I'm wearing and my exact location in the park so it's easy to
  find the group.\n\nLooking forward to a great evening of music and meetin
 g new people. Hope you can join us! 🎸☀️
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315729799/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260717T235349Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T235349Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
